category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libboost-devel
sdesc: "Yet Another HTTP Library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "YaHTTP aims to be a pure http request/response parser that has no IO ties. It
is intended to be used on small-footprint applications and other utilities
that want to use HTTP over something else than network IO."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/cmouse/yahttp
license: MIT
